{
  "title": "The Reincarnated Dimensional Mage Wants to Stand Out While Keeping His Identity Hidden",
  "description": "\"With this power, couldn't I become a mysterious mage who stands out while no one knows who he is?\" \nHigashiyama Touri is reincarnated and granted the ultimate talent for a rare and special type of magic, \"Dimensional Magic\" by God himself. \nDreaming of becoming the cool, enigmatic powerhouse whose name spreads through whispered rumors while he enjoys a quiet drink at the bar, Touri decides to act out his fantasy. Right after reincarnating, he rescues an adventurer party from being wiped out by a giant monster. \nExpecting the girls to spread rumors about him, he is shocked when instead... the country’s strongest party, full of beautiful women, starts following him around?!",
  "artist": "Rurihara Zurachy",
  "author": "Nishura Osho",
